{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2649e082d9a2ba37","name":"Entry","source":{"id":"source:reference-2649e082d9a2ba37","title":"Entry","revision":21171,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:17:37Z","sha256":"14f0ccd3ea01e4df0de9d72618f94796c9c36eb867e23a78724a099bf9d9656c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21171","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Entry&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2649e082d9a2ba37","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", the heroes must gain entrance to a possible illegal weapons facility as thugs engage them in combat. As the heroes accrue Failures, additional thugs arrive or additional security measures (such as automated weapons) activate. Each Success indicates another level of security protocol bypassed.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Entry Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Complexity:"]}," 1 (5 Successes before 3 Failures)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested Primary Skills for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," (DC 19):"]}," The heroes can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disable Device"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disable_Device"}," application (which requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Security Kit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Security_Kit","referenceId":"reference:b3de8e74a439451f"},"), or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," application (which requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Kit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Kit","referenceId":"reference:b833f332464890b5"},"). A successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disable Device"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disable_Device"}," check earns a Success. A successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," check removes a Failure caused by a failed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disable Device"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disable_Device"}," check."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Technology)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Technology)"}," (DC 27 or DC 24):"]}," The heroes can try to remember what they know about computer lock systems to bypass the door's security protocols. The standard DC is 27, but it can be reduced to 24 for heroes who have experience in bypassing security locks."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," (DC 24):"]}," The heroes can attempt to slice into the computer interface to bypass the blast door's security protocols. If they accrue a Failure, the interface might sustain damage, in which case the heroes can try to use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to repair it. A successful repair does not accrue a Success in the Skill Challenge but instead removes the Failure from the previous check."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Challenge Effects"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Challenge Effects"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Challenge_Effects"}," for this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Close Call"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Close_Call","referenceId":"reference:06e10d30642aaca6"},":"]}," Because of variance in security protocols, some attempts yield no change in the outcome. The heroes accrue Failures only on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," that fail by 5 or more."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Challenge","referenceId":"reference:563191d8a5e759b3"},":"]}," Since the heroes are engaged in combat, they must act in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Order"}," during the Skill Challenge."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted_Skills","referenceId":"reference:d30cd9eef2a424bd"},":"]}," The following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," cannot be used in this challenge: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes enter the warehouse to learn whether it contains the illegal weapons.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," Thugs overwhelm the heroes, who are either captured or forced to flee.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
